{"data":{"body":"[P2] Bind each wait segment to its invocation phase. Both wait-parent expectations constrain only the execution ARN, so STARTED and SUCCEEDED wait spans parented and timed within Invocation 2 still satisfy the counts, ordering, and links. Case 21 can therefore pass without a wait segment in the suspending invocation. Require `$occurrence: 1` for the STARTED parent and `$occurrence: 2` for the SUCCEEDED parent, with a regression placing both segments in the same invocation.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABBC_19Q","finding_digest":"a1cd4bfde51422156c11a9d7e36e6f92f91af47a0928311b73fe048e62e3a7e9","finding_id":"arf_v1_uhgux7pfcqrbk3arvhl6g3tpsl","finding_key":"otel-invocation-21::replay-wait-parent::invocation-phase-correlation","identity_key":"otel-invocation-21::replay-wait-parent::invocation-phase-correlation","line":145,"observation_digest":"92d3f1158f3654fde8f9b915fd3353ffb7f8f00dff2041adca59f50cf26bfe66","observation_id":"aro_v1_slj7cfmpgzkp32hzxek72m2t76","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-invocation/otel-invocation-21.yaml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-24T00:05:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ckklp5lnfidynmv4rqdgw2ondb","reviewed_base_sha":"fac2fef2ba9456e6000d57556c8a22266d191c47","reviewed_head_sha":"298dd6e585f3b3ad0bb2c1a54249727a2ad3d261","reviewer":"codex","start_line":141,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_kb3adozxhdksxpxywvpnitj5sf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-24T00:05:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
